usage: play.py [-h] --checkpoint CHECKPOINT [--num_envs NUM_ENVS]
               [--steps STEPS] [--device DEVICE] [--headless] [--video VIDEO]
               [--video_result VIDEO_RESULT] [--command VX VY WZ]
               [--pose-command ROLL PITCH HEIGHT] [--support-mode {0,1,2}]

VALIDATION_SIM: deterministic mjlab checkpoint playback and vx/vy video.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
  --num_envs NUM_ENVS
  --steps STEPS
  --device DEVICE
  --headless
  --video VIDEO
  --video_result VIDEO_RESULT
  --command VX VY WZ
  --pose-command ROLL PITCH HEIGHT
                        Fixed roll/pitch targets in radians and base_link
                        height in meters
  --support-mode {0,1,2}
                        Fixed support goal: 0 left, 1 right, 2 both
